# Hidden Files — Sensitive Data & Tooling (custom extension flag)
#  - *.--HIDDEN files contain plaintext secrets, encryption keys, or
#    tooling that should never appear on the public web.
#  - Encrypted counterparts (without --HIDDEN) are safe to commit.
*.--HIDDEN

